; DIMDIAMETER, the Mtext option with a text without <> ([0.8.1-RT3], work #930): before Text, as
; AutoCAD ([testoM/Testo/Angolo] in autocad-quote.txt, dxf-test-file 5170f18); from the
; command line it asks "Enter dimension text <measurement>:", with the value of
; "Dimension text = 20" (PT3 card, point 3), and writes the replaced text.
; Values as dimdiameter/arco-polilinea (same arc and location): with <> the value
; ⌀20 takes its place (ADR 0047, point 3).
PLINE
0,0
20,0
A
20,20

DIMDIAMETER
30,10
; cambia con #930
M
Foro
35,25
